    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>MSVU has three furnished residence buildings for your accommodation:</p><ul><li>Assisi Hall</li><li>The Birches</li><li>Westwood</li></ul><p>The accommodations at MSVU offer facilities such as a library, a cafeteria, a gym, a closet with storage space, a microwave, a double bed, a dresser with 3 drawers, high-speed internet and indoor access to all of the campus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Sports",
      "value": "<p>Sports include baseball, basketball, cross country, golf, lacrosse, soccer, and volleyball.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Laboratory",
      "value": "<p>MSVU has lab facilities such as:</p><ul><li>Alzheimer’s Research Group Atlantic Root Symbiosis Laboratory</li><li>Bone Development Laboratory</li><li>Functional Foods and Nutritional Physiology Lab</li><li>Milk and Micronutrient Assessment Lab</li></ul>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Cafeteria",
      "value": "<p>MSVU has the Rosaria dining hall that provides delicious and healthy meals. Its dining hall is open from morning to evening, Monday to Sunday.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>You can enjoy the endless events and activities, such as awards night banquets, contests and giveaways, clubs and societies, awareness campaigns, orientation and frosh week, summer camp, photography, lobbying activities, exam boot camps, wellness programs, the winter carnival, ever famous Shinerama, grab class events, employment workshops, and textbook trading fairs.</p><p>MSVU has a student union and professional team that includes the council, managers, staff, and volunteers. Their team’s primary work is to identify your needs and issues.</p><p>Suppose you are a first-year or graduation student or facing transition difficulty, the team will help you resolve your troubles, and they will implement the changes in the Mount student community.</p><p>Assisi Hall's Mount Health office provides health consultations from Monday to Friday.</p><p>Mount Counselling Services offers you free academic and personnel counselling. Their professionals and staff can figure out your requirements, and they will ensure your health and wellness throughout your educational journey.</p>",
